        <h1>Origami in N dimensions: How feed-forward networks manufacture linear separability</h1>
        <div class="ltx_abstract">
          <h6>Abstract</h6>
          <p>Feed-forward networks fold input space into representations whose classes can be separated.</p>
        </div>
        <h2>1 Introduction</h2>
        <p>The paper studies the geometry of the folding process.</p>
        <figure>
